{'symbol': 'F', 'date': '2019-10-28 22:30:00', 'title': 'CELLINK CORPORATION ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS RECEIVED $22.5 MILLION IN FUNDING FROM A GROUP OF INVESTORS', 'text': 'CELLINK CORPORATION ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS RECEIVED $22.5 MILLION IN A ROUND OF FUNDING ON OCTOBER 29, 2019. THE TRANSACTION INCLUDED PARTICIPATION FROM FRANKLIN VENTURE PARTNERS, FONTINALIS PARTNERS, LLC, BMW I VENTURES, FORD MOTOR COMPANY (NYSE:F), LEAR CORPORATION (NYSE:LEA), 3M VENTURES, SK TELECOM CO.,LTD (KOSE:A017670), ROBERT BOSCH VENTURE CAPITAL GMBH, AND BAND OF ANGELS.'}{'symbol': 'F', 'date': '2019-10-27 22:30:00', 'title': 'UNIFOR SAYS FORD ADVISED UNION THAT OAKVILLE RESTRUCTURING WILL RESULT IN LOSS OF 450 JOBS IN FEB. 2020', 'text': "OCT 28  - UNIFOR::UNIFOR - IS RENEWING ITS CALL FOR NEW PRODUCT ALLOCATION AT OAKVILLE ASSEMBLY PLANT FOLLOWING TODAY'S RESTRUCTURING ANNOUNCEMENT BY FORD MOTOR COMPANY.UNIFOR - FORD HAS ADVISED UNION THAT RESTRUCTURING AT OAKVILLE ASSEMBLY WILL RESULT IN LOSS OF 450 JOBS IN FEBRUARY 2020.UNIFOR - NEGOTIATIONS BETWEEN UNIFOR AND FORD FOR A NEW COLLECTIVE AGREEMENT ARE SCHEDULED TO TAKE PLACE IN 2020.UNIFOR - FORD HAS ADVISED THAT RESTRUCTURING AT OAKVILLE ASSEMBLY WILL RESULT IN ELIMINATION OF APPROXIMATELY 200 JOBS IN SEPTEMBER 2019."}